        <para>This is dummy text. The demonstration unit (DDU) supplies the <emphasis emphasisType="em01">dummy system A</emphasis> with dummy output at a nominal value of 100 units. The dummy unit is a placeholder assembly used only to show the layout. Refer to <internalRef internalRefId="fig-0001" internalRefTargetType="irtt01"/> for the location of the components.</para>
        <para>The dummy unit has these dummy characteristics:</para>
